SUMMARY:Ithra Readers Club
DESCRIPTION:Ithra Readers Club is an enriching youth forum where books from a variety of fields are discussed in public each month. The club aims to create a reader-friendly community and encourage discussions and analysis of serious books in a stimulating and liberating atmosphere. The books have been chosen by a committee from the Ithra Library team and have been approved by members before official club events. Today&rsquo\;s reader is tomorrow's leader. The program will discuss the following: Book Discussion: This is Not a Bullet\, With Raed Al-Bughli (April 7\, 2026) Book Discussion: Ethics in the Age of Shallowness\, With Hosni Malek (May 5\, 2026) Book Discussion: Mister\, Mister\, With Hassan Ismail (Ju
LOCATION:Ithra - Library - Level 2
